sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor V as Visitor
  participant N as Next.js (site)
  participant A as FastAPI
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant W as Worker
  participant S as Sales (email / WhatsApp)
  V->>N: Fill enquiry form, tick consent
  N->>A: POST /api/v1/public/leads (proxied, UTM + click IDs)
  A->>DB: rate-limit bucket (IP + phone)
  A->>A: honeypot check, validate, normalise phone to +91
  A->>DB: one transaction: lead + consent snapshot + activity + assignment + outbox(lead.created)
  A-->>N: 201 {reference}
  N-->>V: Thank-you state
  W->>DB: claim pending outbox events (SKIP LOCKED)
  W->>S: new-lead alert to assigned person / sales inbox
  W->>W: CRM webhooks, ad conversions (only with consent)
  W->>DB: mark event done, or retry with backoff
